 "notes": [
  "Matched the concept facade with a two-car porch on the right, drawing room on the left, and an upper-level balcony + vertical wood screen band.",
  "Designed a step-free ground-floor suite with a wide door and large attached bath for the elderly mother, directly accessible from the central TV lounge.",
  "Provided a guest entry from the porch directly into the drawing room, while the open kitchen connects seamlessly with the TV lounge and dining area.",
  "Positioned the 5 kW solar panel array on the unshaded front-right roof terrace and placed the concrete overhead water tank beside the stair mumty."
 ],
